# ZeroX Admin Dashboard — PRODUCTION muhit
# Backend API:  https://app.zerox.uz
# Frontend:     prod admin domeni (*.zerox.uz — prod CORS ruxsat etadi)
#
# `npm run build` (Vite production rejimida) SHU faylni ishlatadi va `.env` (test)
# qiymatlarini ustidan yozadi. `npm run dev` esa `.env` (tb.zerox.uz) da qoladi.
# Build natijasi (dist/) prod admin veb-serverga joylanadi; brauzer to'g'ridan-to'g'ri
# app.zerox.uz ga so'rov yuboradi.

VITE_API_BASE=https://app.zerox.uz/api/v1
VITE_APP_BASE=https://app.zerox.uz
VITE_PDF_BASE=https://pdf.zerox.uz
